Other Programming Trends

•
Recreation departments now often serve as a coordinating agency and a clearinghouse for
multiple recreation organizations and providers, in an effort to bring a comprehensive
scope of recreation programs to a community.  This has also increased the number of
partnerships that are in place to deliver a broader base of programs in a more cost-
effective manner.

