Subject: Online Survey Summary

Introduction
The Cheyenne Parks and Recreation Master Plan survey was conducted from April 8th, 2024, to May 14th, 2024.
The survey included 18 questions regarding Cheyenne’s park system and demographic questions to give some
context to the responses. Feedback will help guide the City of Cheyenne in planning for park, trail, open space, and
recreational amenities over the course of the next ten years. The survey received 710 total responses. Responses to
the verbatim open-ended responses to the Survey Questions and the Qualtrics raw survey results are listed at the
end of the report.

Question 1: How often do you visit Cheyenne’s parks or recreation facilities?

Key Takeaways
Participants most commonly use Cheyenne’s parks or recreation facilities several days a week. Approximately 68%
of respondents visit Cheyenne’s parks and recreation facilities at least once a week. 16% of respondents visit
Cheyenne’s parks and recreation facilities once a month or less. This question received 658 total responses.

