Question 10: Please rate the existing condition of the following types of properties maintained by the city.

Key Takeaways
61% of respondents indicated overall park daily maintenance is good or excellent. 42% of respondents indicated that
community centers and indoor recreation have a poor or average condition. 25% of respondents selected that
community parks have excellent existing conditions. This question received 2,515 responses from 447 respondents.

Question 11: Do you have any comments regarding existing conditions?

This question received 165 written responses. See the Open-ended Question Responses for the full list of open-
ended responses.

Question 12. For each type of facility, please indicate if there is too much, too little, or the right amount to
serve the community.

Key Takeaways
73% of respondents indicated that there is a need for more indoor recreation spaces. 53% of respondents indicated
there is a need for more outdoor swimming/spray water play and restroom facilities. At least 20% of respondents
identified there being too little of each facility. This question received 9,834 responses from 441 respondents. This
question received 44 written responses in the “Other” Category, listed in the Open-ended Question Responses.

Question 13: Please indicate if the city offers too much, too little, or the right amount of the following types
of programs.

Key Takeaways
51% of respondents believe that there is a lack of outdoor education, nature exploration programming provided by
the city. At least 40% of respondents selected that there are too few programs for teens, people with low household
income, and people with special needs. This question received 3,356 Responses from 418 respondents. There were
no written responses indicated for the “Other” Category.

Question 14: Communities provide parks, recreational amenities, trails, and open spaces for a variety of
reasons. Please rate how important you think each of these purposes is for Cheyenne.

Key Takeaways
Providing places and programs for people to maintain and improve their health and fitness, providing places for all to
play, and protecting natural environments were identified as the top three most important purposes. This question
received 5,367 responses from 421 respondents and 52 written responses in the “Other” Category, listed in the
Open-ended Question Responses.

